    "path": "/mnt/e/skillpilot-chemie-L7-20261017/current439-AV-and-native-registry-integration-root-v1/capsule/curricula/DE/Gymnasium/input/RP/Chemie_Sekundarstufe_I_Biologie_Physik_Chemie_2014.pdf",
